WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,050
It’s a good thing to buy a house, you choose it yourself

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,330
If you choose, tell me

3
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:07,170
Uncle Chen has no opinion, just one security standard.

4
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:08,530
The first closure is the community

5
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,930
Strangers must register when entering or exiting

6
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,650
Second, the floor should not be too high or too low.

7
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:12,690
The conditions for knocking on the house should be better

8
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:14,490
Third, public area surveillance without sound angle

9
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:16,050
If you meet these three conditions, buy whatever you want.

10
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:19,630
Do you think you have to go through the security officer to buy a house?

11
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,980
Your safety is top priority now, right?

12
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:25,660
Your company registration is complete, everything is fine.

13
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,700
It just so happened that Academician Lin’s hourly line was also open.

14
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,340
The core parameters of the manager are all right

15
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:40,780
I'll leave the money there for you guys to see if you need it. Say hello to me, Xiaozi, Wang Xiaoqing, you guys go out and do the mission first.
